    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lu'duko ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Ki'la muntu' mugati' na V'aizilaeli, ninga mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo ikalile mugati' na inywe, u'yo alamufumye mwana wakwe ninga yu'mo na ku'mupa kalu'mbi'lo mulungu Moleki, yi'li'mudima muntu' mwenu'yo awu'lagwe. V'antu' v'a iv'ilingano lyeni'lo v'alamuwu'lage ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanne ndamupe nkonya muntu' mwenu'yo, na ku'musinia mu iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. Ku'nguno ku' ku'mufumya yu'mo mugati' na v'ana v'akwe ku'mwa Moleki, alav'e wahav'ezezya zoma hantu' hasondo ha wanne, na ku'li'yagazya lina lyanne isondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lu' iv'ilingano li'mulingi'li'lile du' muntu' mwenu'yo, aho ali'mufumya mwana wakwe ninga yu'mo ku'mwa Moleki, nav'o v'aleke ku'muwu'laga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ene mweni'ki'li' ndamupe nkonya muntu' mwenu'yo haki'mo na igongo lyakwe, nanne ndamukome na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli, haki'mo na v'antu' v'enav'o v'ose av'o v'alamulonde ki'gele ku'kav'ezya wu'lav'a na Moleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Hangi' u'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alav'ayi'le v'a mizimu na v'alagu'zi ku'kav'ezya wu'lav'a, ndamupe nkonya muntu' mwenu'yo, na ku'mukoma na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Yi'li'mudima mwisondohye, na inywe muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzidime nhama zyanne na ku'zilonda. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'musondohya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo amutyomokele ise ninga nnina, yi'lamudime awu'lagwe. Wamutyomokelaga ise ninga nnina, na magazi gakwe galav'e ha igu'lya yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muntu' asihye na muki' wa muntu' mwiye, v'asihya v'enav'o v'av'i'li' yi'lav'adime v'awu'lagwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muntu' alale na muki' wamwa ise, sanga wamuv'i'nzi'la isima ise. Mugosya mwenu'yo na muki'ma mwenu'yo v'ose v'av'i'li' yi'li'v'adima v'awu'lagwe, na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya yav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muntu' alale na mukamwane, yi'lav'adime v'ose v'av'i'li' v'awu'lagwe. V'alav'e v'av'ezyaga wu'v'ipya, na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya yav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' mugosya alale na mugosya mwiye ki'ti' i'vyo ali'v'ezyaga ku' muki'ma, v'agosya v'enav'o v'alav'e v'av'ezya igayi'li'zyo. Yi'lav'adime v'awu'lagwe na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya yav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
