          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo amutoole ilu'mbu'ye, mwaniki' mwana wamwa ise, ninga wamwa nnina, na kwikala haki'mo, lyeni'lo li'li' igambo lya nsoni. Yi'lav'adime v'akomwe ha minso ga iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. Mugosya mwenu'yo walalaga na ilu'mbu'ye, yi'lamudime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
