          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na sengiyo ninga nnoko muhanya ninga nnoko mudo, ku'nguno v'enav'o v'ali' v'a igongo lya bi'hi' nanho. V'ose av'o v'alav'ezye vyeni'vyo yi'lav'adime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muntu' alale na muki' lyamwa ise muhanya ninga mudo, sanga wamuv'i'nzi'la isima ise muhanya ninga mudo. V'ose v'av'i'li' yi'lav'adime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, na v'alafwe bila ku'v'yala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muntu' atoole muki' wa muku'lu'ye ninga muki' wa muzunaye, yeni'yo yi'li' zoma, sanga wamuv'i'nzi'la isima mudu'gu'ye. V'ose v'av'i'li' v'akasye v'av'yale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Muzidime nhama na nzi'la zyanne zyose, na ku'zidoonoka, ki'gele nsi' i'yo nu'mufila ku'du' yi'mulu'ke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nhana ku'du' mwikale ku' ku'londa ki'ti'le cha v'antu' v'a nsi' av'o nu'v'asaga ha mbele yinywe. Ku'nguno ndi' v'av'ezya magambo gose genaga, na ku'nguno ya genaga hene nav'agayile muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ene namuwi'lile inywe, mulayi'saale nsi' yav'o, nanne nu'mupa inywe ku'yi'tema nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki'. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, u'yo namukomile inywe ku'fuma ku' makabi'la gangi'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'nguno yeni'yo, yi'li'mudima ku'mani'cha ndimu nsoso na zya zoma, hangi' na nnoni nsoso na zya zoma. Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye zoma ku'nguno ya ndimu ninga yi'mo, ninga nnoni, ninga vitundwa vido vido vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', i'vyo navikomile ku'v'a vili' zoma ku'nguno yinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulav'e v'asondo ku' wanne, ku'nguno ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ni' musondo, nanne namukomile inywe ku'fuma ku' makabi'la muv'e nsawo yanne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Hangi' mugosya ninga muki'ma u'yo ali' na mizimu, ninga mulagu'zi, nhana alawu'lagwe ku' ku'gu'mwa na mawe, na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya na mitwe zyav'o.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
